<title>GERMANY: SOCCER-GERMAN FIRST DIVISION SUMMARY.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-GERMAN FIRST DIVISION SUMMARY.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1996-09-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of a German first division match on Sunday:</p>
<p>Bayer Leverkusen 5 (Kirsten 24th minute, Sergio 32nd, Feldhoff 56th penalty, Heintze 78th, Lehnhoff 85th) Freiburg 3 (Frey 14th, Sutter 68th, Wassmer 86th). Halftime 2-1. Attendance 18,000.</p>
</text>
